  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 501.01 Purpose. The purpose of We 500 is to establish minimum standards of ethical conduct and professional performance and to protect the rights of consumers, investors and industries living or doing business in the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #2557, eff 12-27-83; EXPIRED: 12-27-89\n\nNew. #6449, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17 (See Revision Notes at Chapter headings for We 300 and We 600)",
